{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026CDR8ZPFVIB1793327309.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審，前家翁鄺球改認阻止合法埋葬屍體罪。</p><p></p><p>三名被告包括，蔡天鳳前夫鄺港智、前家翁鄺球及前大伯鄺港傑各被控一項謀殺罪，及一項阻止合法埋葬屍體罪。</p><p></p><p>開審前鄺港智及鄺港傑已承認阻止合法埋葬屍體罪，鄺球則否認控罪。踏入第27日審訊，鄺球在陪審團席前改為承認控罪。至於謀殺罪，三名被告均繼續否認。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:05:38.353332+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T02:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:38:54.965185+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:00:01.686978+00:00","content_hash":"509cdc891139f16ded328cd06ea4dbdaa86f5a902b5580827c3ab8a1c5aa0492","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:05:38.353332+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}